    ns1:sourceSummary "Borderlands is a 2024 American science fiction action comedy film directed and co-written by Eli Roth, based on the video game series. Cate Blanchett stars as Lillith, an outlaw who forms an alliance with a team of misfits to find the missing daughter of the most powerful man in the universe. The ensemble cast also features Kevin Hart, Jack Black, Edgar Ramirez, Ariana Greenblatt, Florian Munteanu, Gina Gershon, and Jamie Lee Curtis." ;
    ns1:title "Borderlands (film)" ;
    ns1:writtenBy ns1:entity_craig_mazin ;
