    ns1:sourceSummary "Ghudchadi is a 2024 Indian Hindi-language romantic comedy film directed by Binoy Gandhi and written by Deepak Kapur Bhardwaj. Produced by Nidhi Dutta, Binoy Gandhi, Bhushan Kumar and Krishan Kumar under the banner of Keep Dreaming Pictures and T-Series. A remake of the blockbuster Bengali film Projapati (2022), it stars Sanjay Dutt and Raveena Tandon with Parth Samthaan, Khushalii Kumar and Aruna Irani in pivotal roles.The film was premiered on JioCinema on 9 August 2024." ;
