    ns1:sourceSummary "Beverly Hills Cop: Axel F is a 2024 American action comedy film directed by Mark Molloy, written by Will Beall, Tom Gormican, and Kevin Etten from a story by Beall, the fourth installment in the Beverly Hills Cop film series and a sequel to Beverly Hills Cop III (1994). Eddie Murphy, Judge Reinhold, John Ashton, Paul Reiser, and Bronson Pinchot reprise their roles from previous films in the franchise, while Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Taylour Paige, and Kevin Bacon star in new roles. The film was Ashton's final role; he died two months following its release." ;
    ns1:title "Beverly Hills Cop: Axel F" ;
