    ns1:sourceSummary "Demonte Colony 2 is a 2024 Indian Tamil-language supernatural horror thriller film directed by R. Ajay Gnanamuthu. Produced by BTG Universal, Gnanamuthu Pattarai and White Nights Entertainment, it is the second instalment in the Demonte Colony film series and serves both a sequel and prequel to Demonte Colony (2015). The film stars Arulnithi and Priya Bhavani Shankar in the lead roles, alongside Arun Pandian, Antti Jääskeläinen, Tsering Dorjee, Meenakshi Govindarajan, Sarjano Khalid and Archana Ravichandran." ;
