    ns1:sourceSummary "Gender Reveal is a Canadian short comedy horror film, written and directed by Mo Matton and released in 2024. The film stars Ayo Tsalithaba as Rhys, a non-binary and polyamorous people pleaser who reluctantly brings their partners Ting and Mati to the gender reveal party of their boss Marc and his pregnant wife Chloe, only to witness events at the party spiral horrifically out of control." ;
