    ns1:sourceSummary "Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba – To the Hashira Training , also known simply as Demon Slayer: To the Hashira Training, is a 2024 Japanese animated dark fantasy action feature-length compilation of \"Swordsmith Village\" and \"Hashira Training\" arcs from the 2016–20 manga series Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba by Koyoharu Gotouge. It is a direct sequel to the third season of the anime television series as well as its second feature-length compilation of episodes released in movie theaters, following Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba – To the Swordsmith Village (2023). The episodes in the compilation are directed by Haruo Sotozaki and written by Ufotable staff members." ;
