    ns1:sourceSummary "Dange (transl. Rioting) / Por (transl. War) is a 2024 Indian action drama film directed by Bejoy Nambiar. The film was shot simultaneously in Hindi and Tamil and stars Harshvardhan Rane and Ehan Bhat in the Hindi version while Arjun Das and Kalidas Jayaram starin the Tamil version. Nikita Dutta, Sanchana Natarajan and TJ Bhanu appear in supporting roles." ;
