    ns1:sourceSummary "The Antisocial Network: Memes to Mayhem is a 2024 documentary film directed by Arthur Jones and Giorgio Angelini that explores the intersection of internet culture and real-world politics. It was released as a follow-up to Jones' previous work, Feels Good Man. The film discusses the anonymous image board 4chan, and includes interviews from anonymous hackers and ex-members of the website. The film premiered at the 2024 South by Southwest Film Festival." ;
    ns1:title "The Antisocial Network (film)" ;
    owl:sameAs <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q124848151> .

