    ns1:sourceSummary "The Girl with the Needle is a 2024 Gothic historical psychological horror film directed by Magnus von Horn, from a screenplay written by von Horn and Line Langebek. Set in 1919, the film stars Vic Carmen Sonne as a young woman who begins working as a wet nurse at a secretive adoption agency for disadvantaged mothers, but grows suspicious over one of the women who runs the operation. It is very loosely based on the true story of Danish serial killer Dagmar Overbye." ;
    ns1:title "The Girl with the Needle" ;
