    ns1:sourceSummary "Dancing Village: The Curse Begins is a 2024 Indonesian supernatural horror film. It is an adaptation of the novel KKN di Desa Penari by SimpleMan. This film was produced by MD Pictures and stars Aulia Sarah, Maudy Effrosina, and Jourdy Pranata. It is a prequel to the 2022 movie KKN di Desa Penari, that follows the story of Badarawuhi, a mysterious dancer who chooses female dancers as sacrifice in the first film." ;
