    ns1:sourceSummary "Back Bencherz is a 2024 Indian Kannada-language comedy drama film written and directed by BR Rajashekar. Produced by Ramya Rajshekar under Police Praki Production, and starring Jathin Aryan, Akash MP, Shashank Simha, Manya Gowda, Kunkum H, Anusha Suresh, Manoj Shetty, Namith Gowda and Suchendra Prasad. The film was theatrically released on 19 July 2024." ;
