    ns1:sourceSummary "Bachchala Malli is a 2024 Indian Telugu-language period drama film written and directed by Subbu Mangadevvi, and produced by Razesh Danda and Balaji Gutta through Hasya Movies. The film stars Allari Naresh and Amritha Aiyer in the lead roles, while Rao Ramesh, Kota Jayaram, and Rohini play supporting roles. The music was composed by Vishal Chandrasekhar with cinematography by Richard M. Nathan and editing by Chota K. Prasad. The film was released on 20 December 2024 and opened to mixed reviews from critics." ;
