    ns1:pageURL "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gautama_Buddha_Matha"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    ns1:sourceSummary "Gautama Buddha Matha is a 2024 Sri Lankan Sinhalese biographical film directed by Prof. Sunil Ariyaratne and produced by Thilanga Sumathipala for Sumathi Universal Private Limited. The film stars both Sri Lankan and Indian cast, where Indian actress Phalguni Khanna made lead titular role along with Aditi Singh, Tushar Chhibber, Himanshi Jain, Dilhani Ekanayake, Dhananjaya Siriwardena, Anuradha Mallavarachchi and Sampath Jayaweera made supportive roles. The film reveals the life of Mahapajapati Gotami, the revered queen and foster mother of Gautama Buddha who later became the first Bhikkhunī of the Buddha Sasana." ;
    ns1:title "Gautama Buddha Matha" ;
    owl:sameAs <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q131398577> .

