    ns1:sourceSummary "Chasing Time is a 2024 American documentary short film directed by the first time filmmaker Sarah Keo and Jeff Orlowski. The film offers a reflective examination of time and mortality as it follows nature photographer James Balog and his team during the final phase of a multi‑decade project that has produced more than one million images. The short documentary reunites Balog with the Emmy Award-winning team behind Chasing Ice." ;
