    ns1:sourceSummary "Class of Her Own is a documentary feature film by Boaz Dvir released in 2024. The documentary captures Gloria Merriex’s transformation into an educational innovator and shows her engaging her math, reading, and science students at the most effective levels through unconventional teaching practices, which included hip-hop and dance routines." ;
    ns1:title "Class of Her Own" ;
    owl:sameAs <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q17514177> .

